<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title>Request Admin Access — WGS Payment Tracker</title>
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#2c3e50">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #27ae60;
            --primary-dark: #219653;
            --bg-color: #f4f6f9;
            --text-dark: #2c3e50;
            --text-muted: #64748b;
            --shadow-soft: 0 12px 35px rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.08);
            --shadow-btn: 0 6px 15px rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.3);
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg-color);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .box {
            background: white;
            padding: 35px 30px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 440px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
            border: 1px solid rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.15);
        }

        h2 {
            margin-top: 0;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .subtitle {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 22px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .info-alert {
            background: #e6f4ea;
            border: 1px solid #a3e0b7;
            color: #1e7e44;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 12px;
            text-align: left;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        input,
        select {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px 14px;
            margin: 6px 0 14px 0;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 14px;
            background: #f8fafc;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            outline: none;
            color: var(--text-dark);
        }

        input:focus,
        select:focus {
            border-color: var(--primary);
            background: white;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.15);
        }

        label {
            display: block;
            text-align: left;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        button {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-dark));
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 25px;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-top: 10px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 15px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-btn);
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.4);
        }

        .back-link {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 18px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

        .back-link:hover {
            color: var(--primary-dark);
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="box">
        <h2>Request Admin Access</h2>
        <div class="subtitle">Submit your details to request an Admin account. Super Admin will review your request for approval.</div>

        <div class="info-alert">
            ℹ️ <strong>Note:</strong> Super Admin approval is required to activate your account. Please enter your valid Email & Phone so we can contact you regarding your account setup.
        </div>

        <form action="/register" method="POST">
            <label>Admin Username</label>
            <input type="text" name="username" placeholder="Choose Admin Username" required>

            <label>Secure Password</label>
            <input type="password" name="password" placeholder="Choose Password" required>

            <label>Email Address</label>
            <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="your.email@example.com" required>

            <label>Phone / WhatsApp Number</label>
            <input type="tel" name="phone" placeholder="+91 9876543210" required>

            <label>Security Question (For Recovery):</label>
            <select name="securityQuestion">
                <option value="pet">What is your first pet's name?</option>
                <option value="school">What is your first school name?</option>
                <option value="city">In which city were you born?</option>
            </select>
            <input type="text" name="securityAnswer" placeholder="Your Security Answer" required>

            <button type="submit">Submit Access Request</button>
        </form>
        <a href="/login" class="back-link">&larr; Back to Login</a>
    </div>
</body>

</html>